  "details": "If avoid heavy use of the photo camera, it's not a big problem, so I don't think many people will be bothered by it, but I would appreciate it if you could fix it when you have the time.\n\nIf record 8K60fps using OBS game capture, which far exceeds the number of shots a photo camera can take, it will work fine without using 64GB of RAM, so it is strange to waste 128GB of RAM on a photo camera.\n\nAs far as I know, this has been happening since last year and is still ongoing.",
